{"5343850":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"I Hate Scalpers","steam_appid":5343850,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5375050],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I HATE SCALPERS. SO WE BONK THEM!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never liked scalpers. Always making my card prices go up and never available. I just want to collect them! So I made a game to bonk them away. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5343850\/extras\/f0d19fe79a540d00e381901a7d58f9f6.poster.avif?t=1793775723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5343850\/extras\/f0d19fe79a540d00e381901a7d58f9f6.webm?t=1793775723\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5343850\/extras\/f0d19fe79a540d00e381901a7d58f9f6.mp4?t=1793775723\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ask them questions. Bonk, duel or a true fan?<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5343850\/extras\/b245690a464f421e330d53594abde4b4.poster.avif?t=1793775723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5343850\/extras\/b245690a464f421e330d53594abde4b4.webm?t=1793775723\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5343850\/extras\/b245690a464f421e330d53594abde4b4.mp4?t=1793775723\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interogate. Find discrepencies. Use ur UV light if you have to!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5343850\/extras\/5ad5ab55a8b8077e956e6ae3912c50af.poster.avif?t=1793775723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5343850\/extras\/5ad5ab55a8b8077e956e6ae3912c50af.webm?t=1793775723\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5343850\/extras\/5ad5ab55a8b8077e956e6ae3912c50af.mp4?t=1793775723\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Duel them and win in tournaments in Cut The Line<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5343850\/extras\/91434ceec7366d5b4542871869379437.poster.avif?t=1793775723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5343850\/extras\/91434ceec7366d5b4542871869379437.webm?t=1793775723\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5343850\/extras\/91434ceec7366d5b4542871869379437.mp4?t=1793775723\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your home for your growing collection<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5343850\/extras\/576717ce7df3951aa3b888d2907abc5a.poster.avif?t=1793775723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5343850\/extras\/576717ce7df3951aa3b888d2907abc5a.webm?t=1793775723\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\